flowchart TB
  accTitle: GP-A&#58; deep-kernel GP + Gaussian observation noise
  accDescr: GP-A&#58; deep-kernel GP + Gaussian observation noise&#59; arrows follow patient context and measurements to predictive distributions and training objectives.
  baseline["Patient baseline s&#58; entry covariates"]
  class baseline input
  past["Recorded causal prefix Events / measurements / updates"]
  class past input
  encoder["Common causal Transformer H₀ = E&#40;prefix&#41;"]
  class encoder history
  query["Query age t + feature ID d Arbitrary, irregular times"]
  class query input
  context["Fixed prefix + query context cₜd = &#91;s, H₀, t, e_d&#93;"]
  class context context
  prior["Multi-output GP prior f ∼ GP&#40;mθ, kθ&#41; Learned mean + PSD cross-feature kernel"]
  class prior latent
  observed["Available measurements D Irregular &#40;t, d, y&#41; records"]
  class observed input
  posterior["Exact Gaussian conditioning p&#40;f* &#124; D&#41;"]
  class posterior latent
  noise["Independent Gaussian noise εG ∼ N&#40;0, Σ&#41;"]
  class noise private
  observation["Predictive observation distribution y* = f* + εG"]
  class observation output
  output["Return clinical units Mean / quantiles / joint samples"]
  class output output
  loss["Train&#58; exact marginal NLL −log N&#40;y&#59; m, K + Σ&#41;"]
  class loss loss
  past --> encoder
  baseline --> context
  encoder --> context
  query --> context
  context --> prior
  prior --> posterior
  observed -->|Condition on known y| posterior
  noise -->|Noise in conditioning covariance| posterior
  posterior -->|Joint latent draws f*| observation
  noise -->|Future noise| observation
  observation -->|Undo training standardisation| output
  prior -.-> loss
  observed -.-> loss
  noise -.-> loss
